{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39078","headline":"句 · 褚载","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢多是醉醺然，应有囊中子母钱。\n有兴欲沽红麴酒，无人同上翠旌楼。\n星斗离披烟霭收，玉蟾蜍耀海东头。\n鹿胎冠子水晶簪，长啸欹眠紫桂阴。\n躞蹀马摇金络脑，婵娟人坠玉搔头。\n狂歌放饮浑成性，知道逍遥出俗笼。\n除却洛阳才子後，更谁封恨吊怀沙。\n莲浦浪澄堪倚钓，柳堤风煖好垂鞭。\n上马等闲销白日，出门轻薄倚黄金。\n净名方丈虽然病，曼倩年涯未有多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚载","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}